# What is containerization ?
= its a way of deploying application onto many servers.
= its packaging an application along with its dependies as a single deployable package.

# What is docker ?
= Docker is an open platform for developing, shipping, and running applications.

# how do you build and run container packages ?
= we need containerization/container runtime tool.

# what is docker image ?
= its the package of an application along with its dependies as single deployable package.
= whicb is ready to use as a software application bundle that is sitting on your hard disk bundle.

# what is docker container ?.
= is the runtime instance of an image/application.
= runtime instance is always the running process that consume the cpu/ram.
= single container = single instance of an application.
= from single image we can run multiple containers.

# how you build a docker image ?.
